  "title": "Flaming Swords",
  "description": "Makes the Fire Aspect Enchantment show flames",
  "body": "<center>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/398e12c2605ef9c77750a151c2c8420b528836e8.png\" width=\"700\" alt=\"Flaming Swords Logo\"><br>\n\n## Makes the Fire Aspect Enchantment show flames\n<br>\n\n[![View the pack on my website!](https://img.shields.io/badge/View%20the%20pack%20on%20my%20website!-black?style=for-the-badge)](https://mr-expence.github.io/projects/flaming-swords)\n<br><br>\n<br><br>\n\nThis Resource pack changes the texture for swords when you enchant it with Fire Aspect.\n\nIt needs a cit mod for 1.21.4 or below as 1.21.5 adds custom item textures.\n\nThere are diffrent colours for the Copper and Netherite swords\n\n3D Mace and Bow from tixul's Enchantment Outlines\n\nFlaming Swords now has support for tixul's [Enchantment Outlines](https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/glowing-glints)\n\nYou can toggle parts of the resource pack using [ResPackOpts](https://modrinth.com/mod/respackopts)\n\nIf there is no animations try turning off `Animate Only Visible Textures` in the Video Settings\n<br><br><br>\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/4638a6a686ae36d813e716894a67f75c4fe3cc33.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Wooden Sword\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/19b75264e439553404618bbc97e68deaec40f325.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Stone Sword\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/9723049a021e7f69d4528c20c0517f45fcec396b.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Copper Sword\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/da44cda12b205dbe847a44989ff3948f73760b0f.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Iron Sword\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/e4322b6e4ad484a51a2a10322796023659a0eb7b.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Golden Sword\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/71ae0be6700fc9ddefd7225348aa303df000dc1e.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Diamond Sword\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/c18252a5b12dbc4e3ef32a03e85155bfd6187ee6.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Mace\"><br><br>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/EcjQY7O3/images/48f59d31699764b0a5856932a33d0eb3547f8b64.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Bow\"><br><br>\n</center>",
